@RiskBff_HostAddress = http://localhost:5085

### 1. Ingestion Data Preview (Default Page 1, Page Size 10)
GET {{RiskBff_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ingestion/preview
Accept: application/json

### 2. Ingestion Data Preview with Pagination and Search
GET {{RiskBff_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ingestion/preview?page=1&pageSize=10&search=Oak
Accept: application/json

### 3. Ingestion Data Preview Filter by Status
GET {{RiskBff_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ingestion/preview?status=Needs%20Review
Accept: application/json

### 4. Ingestion Data Preview Filter by Validation Status (Errors)
GET {{RiskBff_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ingestion/preview?validationStatus=Error
Accept: application/json

### 5. Ingestion Data Preview for a Specific Upload / Blob Name
GET {{RiskBff_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ingestion/uploads/Utility_Poles_Import_Jan2026.csv/preview?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
